  "body": "Specification: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#textFieldSelection:do-not-apply\r\nWPT: http://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/forms/the-input-element/selection.html\r\n\r\nFor example, ```select()``` for ```<input type=hidden>``` should throw according to the specification and the WPT test. However, none of Edge, Firefox, Google Chrome, and Safari throws.\r\n\r\nProposal: Change the specification so that ```select()``` never throws.\r\n",
